+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction policy with a fixed TTL of 300 seconds applied to all cache entries. This was chosen for its simpler mental model, which makes cache behavior predictable and easier to reason about and debug in production.
